Package: easyRasch2jmv
Type: Package
Title: easyRasch2 for Jamovi
Version: 3.2.2
Date: 2026-09-22
Author: Magnus Johansson
Maintainer: Magnus Johansson <pgmj@pm.me>
Description:  Provides Rasch analysis functions for jamovi. All analyses delegate
  their computations to the easyRasch2 R package (conditional maximum
  likelihood estimation via psychotools with Warm's weighted likelihood
  person estimates; iarm for the conditional item-fit and partial-gamma
  statistics; eRm for Andersen's LR test; lavaan for the CFA checks),
  so results are numerically identical to easyRasch2 with the same
  seeds and iterations.
